	(descr "MDT TMR2615D (DFN3L 2x2x0.55 mm) TMR linear sensor. Pin 1 VOUT, pin 2 VDD, pin 3 GND (large pad). Land from datasheet TMR2615x-AAC Figure 7; toes extended 0.4 mm for hand soldering. Sensing element 0.49 mm from the pin-3 edge, sensing axis in-plane along X (parallel to the pin 1-2 edge). Switch-centred version for the Numpad (switch holes come from the hot-swap socket footprint); package centre offset (-3.089, 1.51), pin-3 edge facing the switch centre line.")
